define(["jquery"],function($){return{init:function(subcategoryData,selectedSubcatId){var categorySelect=$("select[name='categoryid']");var subcategorySelect=$("select[name='subcategoryid']");var subcategoryWrapper=subcategorySelect.closest(".fitem");selectedSubcatId=selectedSubcatId||0;function updateSubcategories(){var selectedCategoryId=parseInt(categorySelect.val(),10);var subcats=subcategoryData[selectedCategoryId]||[];subcategorySelect.find("option:not(:first)").remove();if(subcats.length>0){$.each(subcats,function(i,sub){var option=$("<option>").val(sub.id).text(sub.name);if(sub.id===selectedSubcatId){option.prop("selected",true);}subcategorySelect.append(option);});subcategoryWrapper.show();}else{subcategoryWrapper.hide();subcategorySelect.val(0);}}categorySelect.on("change",function(){selectedSubcatId=0;updateSubcategories();});updateSubcategories();}};});

